  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "An inspiring little game that tackles suicidal ideation in the form of a game. Stay afloat by getting to new resting spots while reading inspirational messages. Depths is a game about survival. You awake in the middle of the ocean, clinging to a piece of driftwood. You have no memory of how you got here, however you know you need to survive. Unsure of your surroundings, you set off to explore. You find yourself feeling weak, and can barely tread water. Yet somehow, you survive. As you travel on, the seas become more treacherous. Can you make it through? Important: This game makes references to suicide. If this is a concern, you may wish to pass this game up."
    }
  ],
